'''Giga-Nyan Rex''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] during the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

