==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Giga-Nyan Prime DX''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Ranger]] is an anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] backline support and DPS hybrid that struggles to even do its job. Despite its impressive coverage of 725 through [[Explosion]]s, it has an agonizingly long attack cycle of nearly 20 seconds. This translates to extremely poor [[Slow]] uptime, barely reaching 15% at most.

While the unit's [[Strong Against]] ability may seem to improve its matchups versus its targeted traits, it ultimately falls short in this aspect as well. With the [[Blood Fruit]] and [[Void Fruit]] at 300%, a Lv.30 Giga-Nyan Prime DX deals 97,920 damage per attack against Red/Dark and 81,600 against Aku. These numbers aren't bad, but are again hindered by its attack cycle. With [[Savage Blow]] factored in, it has, on average, 6,420 DPS against Red/Dark (or 5,350 against Aku), only barely surpassing average backliners like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. The extreme potential burst damage is rendered moot by its horrendous Savage Blow chance, during which many other superior alternatives could accumulate significantly better DPS.

Giga-Nyan Prime DX's most standout characteristic is its [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]] (through [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|Yellow Strike]])/[[Immune to Surge|Surges]]/[[Immune to Explosions|Explosions]], giving it some leverage in stages that would ordinarily deny traditional backliners. But even here, its performance tends to be subpar, with many non-Uber units like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] or [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] faring much better in many regards. Being a viable option is basically its only redeeming quality a lot of the time, putting aside how gamechanging the occasional Savage Blow may be. As a result, this unit is usually only useful until the player unlocks better backline options, or as filler in the [[Underground Labyrinth]].

