==Trivia==
*The "Oh" (オー ''ō'') suffix in Giga-Nyan Rex's Japanese name (ニャンコオー ''Nyankoō'', "Nyanko-Oh") is also part of the names of many [[wikia:powerrangers:Category:Giant Robo|Giant Robo]] from the ''[[wikipedia:Super Sentai Series|Super Sentai Series]]'', such as [[wikia:powerrangers:Ressha Gattai ToQ-Oh|ToQ-Oh]].
*Giga-Nyan Rex's use of a sword and shield may reference [[wikia:powerrangers:Kousoku Gattai Great Five|Great Five]] from ''[[wikia:powerrangers:Hikari Sentai Maskman|Hikari Sentai Maskman]]''.
*Giga-Nyan Rex and [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Evangelist Cat]] are the only legitimately obtainable [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] to not drop from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Cat Capsules|Rare Cat Capsule]].
*Giga-Nyan Rex is the only [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Ranger]] to not:
**Be a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]].
**Have a [[Cat Combo]].
**Have the word for a color in its Evolved Form's name.

